## Why This Is Asked
This question probes cross-process media pipelines, real-time constraints, and security in AR applications—common in mobile vision workloads at scale.

## Key Concepts
- Android isolated processes and Binder IPC
- Ashmem zero-copy buffers and BufferQueue
- JNI/NDK integration for native filters
- Android Keystore hardware-backed keys
- Real-time constraints: latency, jitter, frame drops
- Testing: end-to-end latency, memory budgets, security threats

